Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD review-done patch chats to ready highlighting for
 completion decisions

Treat patch sessions waiting for a completion decision as ready-list candidates so the terminal left pane rings once and keeps the completion prompt visible until the user answers. Preserve closed-chat reopening semantics with controller coverage.
